# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# COMPANY DATA — never commit. This file is written before the directories it
# protects exist, deliberately. It is far easier to never commit shop data than
# to scrub it out of history later.
#
# NOTE ON ANCHORING: the company-data paths below carry a leading slash so they
# match ONLY at the repository root. Unanchored (`copybooks/`), they would also
# match `samples/copybooks/`, which holds committed synthetic test data.
# See PROJECT.md section 5.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/config/shop.yml
/copybooks/
/input/
/output/

# Real copybooks, wherever they land.
*.cpy
*.CPY

# ...except the synthetic ones under samples/, committed on purpose. Anything
# placed there must be invented for this project. If a sample file starts to
# resemble a real record layout, replace it.
!samples/copybooks/*.cpy
!samples/copybooks/*.CPY

# Real BRDs and the golden set live only on the office machine
/samples/real/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Credentials — this project uses GitHub Copilot only. There are no API keys.
# These entries exist so an accidental key file can never be committed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
build/
dist/

# Tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
